OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening across the region, with hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine. Remaining generally dry
OL,8,Fovernight withclear spells and the odd
OL,9,Fshower possible over west Cornwall.
OL,10,FRather warm overnight with light
OL,11,Fwinds, but a little fresher in rural
OL,12,Fspots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FDry, with sunny spells, cloud
OL,15,Fincreasing across the west at times
OL,16,Fturning sunshine hazy. The odd shower
OL,17,Fcannot be ruled out in western areas.
OL,18,FFeeling very warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
