OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRather
OL,6,Fchangeable with sunny spells and well
OL,7,Fscattered showers, these locally heavy
OL,8,Fand perhaps thundery on Tuesday.
OL,9,FTurning somewhat drier from Wednesday,
OL,10,Fwith temperatures returning closer to
OL,11,Faverage.
